! mcp_bootstrap_p335.strap -- MCP printed page 335: the opening of the
! DEBUGGER deck (PUNID 22$DUMP): its punch controls and two (CC*)
! header cards, then the debugger's entry YDBBEG and the console-key
! dispatch (PDB1 .. PE4, PINC), lines 1-51.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.85, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22LOADER  CARD ID VA000001  DIST. OF 3/01
! 3/01  PAGE NUMBER 335" (round glyphs in numeric fields read 0).  The
! heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK (line 1 is a remark banner).
!
! THE PAGE.  51 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.  A "*"
! in the LOCATION column on lines 2 and 5 (no location) and after the
! LOCATION on lines 26 and 45.  No TAIL.
!   line  1      remark banner "---------- DEBUGGER -----".
!   line  2      PUNFUL.
!   lines 3-4    two (CC*)DD(BU,,12) cards at 236464.31 and 236474.65
!                (the deck's "B HED, REP, 22$DUMP, LOAD,," header card
!                images) -- see below.
!   lines 5-7    PUNORG, PUNID,22$DUMP, RESEQ.
!   line  8      SLC,YMPBUF prints 234424.00.
!   lines 9-51   code, contiguous from 234424.00 (YDBBEG) to 234456.00
!                (line 51, B,PE4, a half word; next location 234456.40),
!                then blank paper.  Remark-only lines 12, 17, 33
!                (blank), 34.
!
! JOIN.  This page opens a new program: its card serials restart at
! VA000001, and the header still prints the PREVIOUS PUNID (22LOADER),
! as p.320's header printed 11D11MCP while setting 22LOADER.  Line 8's
! SLC,YMPBUF goes to 234424.00: like the loader (p.320 line 10), the
! debugger is assembled to overlay the YMPBUF buffer, so this page's
! words 234424.00-234456.00 occupy THE SAME ADDRESSES as p.320's
! loader code (merge note for the coordinator).  The deck states
! 236464.31 hard (an SLC stand-in) for line 3; it presumably continues
! the previous page's counter (p.334, not read).  p.336 should open at
! 234456.40 = line 51's next location (line 28's BBZ target PSC prints
! 234456.40) with serial VA000052.
!
! >>> LINES 3-4'S (CC*)DD ARE ASSEMBLED (2026-11-10). <<<
! They used to be comments (their blanks then typed 12 and 30, not
! measured), with two SLC stand-ins at their printed
! locations, because strap_asm refused entry mode CC.  Both assemblers
! now take CC (C28-6129 p.16: each character its card column's
! punches, App. F p.56; the bit order row 12 high is
! ATBL's, printed p.331).  ONE
! stand-in stays: "SLC, (8)236464.31", the counter the page before leaves
! (the JOIN above), since this deck is assembled alone.  It stands
! BEFORE the PUNFUL, so it is not the chart OS "1ST SLC" under PUNFUL.
!
! THE COLUMNS.  Line 3's printed span 236464.31 -> 236474.65 is 540
! bits = 45 twelve-bit characters, and with line 4 the two make
! one 80-column card under PUNFUL.  The blanks are MEASURED in the ink
! (PDF 85 at 300 dpi, the fixed print pitch 29.95 px per cell from the
! statement column): "B" in cell 16, "HED" from cell 25, the "*" in
! cell 61; the second card's name from cell 43.  That is 8 blanks after
! the B and 27 before the name, and it is MCP's control-card form
! (C22-6678-1 pp.7-10): "B" in column 1, "HED, REP, 22$DUMP, LOAD,," from
! column 10, the name in columns 73-80 (the ID field; the PUNID,22$DUMP after
! PUNORG punches the same ID on the binary cards).  Line 3
! is 45 characters, line 4 34; the card's last 1 column(s)
! are PUNFUL's zero fill.  tests/check_strap2_punch.py A5 reads the
! card back; A7 checks line 4 lands at 236474.65.
!
! NOT LOADED.  PUNFUL punches full cards and the loader cannot load one
! (C28-6129 pp.23, 36), so the loaded image does not hold these bits:
! strap_asm emits them into a scratch image (A6 checks).  STRAP II
! keeps them in its assembly image and punches them as the full card,
! which A1's decoder, like MCP's loader, does not load.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 6 "PUNID,22$CUMP" = 22$DUMP: line 3 prints "22$DUMP" with a
!     plain D; worn stem.
!   * "PC4" (line 11) = PD4: landed p.293 line 17 defines PD4; binary
!     232574.10 = p.293's !SYM PD4 232574.00.
!   * "PCB1"/"PDB1" (lines 14, 15, 19, 21) = PDB1: label line 21 at
!     234433.40; every reference prints 234433.74 (= .40).
!   * "PCNOUT"/"PONCUT" (lines 35, 49, 50) = PONOUT (landed p.293 line
!     42; binary 232632.2x = PONOUT+2.0).
!   * "PHOLCB" (line 43) = PHOLDB: C22-6728 "turns the hold bit on
!     (PHOLDB)"; p.294 stand-in at 234663.40, which line 43 prints.
!   * "PDUN"/"PDUM" (line 30): M with a worn right stroke; C22-6728 has
!     no PDUN; written PDUM.
!   * lines 39, 47 "B,D MCP" / "BE,CMCP" = DMCP (landed 32.0; 000040.x).
!   * line 41 ",P C DEF2" = PCDEF2 (landed p.137 SYN,10.0; 000012.00).
!   * line 35 label "P E1" and line 39 "P E2" written PE1, PE2 (blank
!     in a name, as p.294 writes "P DB EX" = PDBEX); C22-6728 "at PE3".
!   * hex bytes "C0"/"CO"/"0C" on B/BE/Z rows = 00 (octal fields of
!     the same rows print 0 open; lesson 6).  "C2" on line 18 is C2.
!   * remark line 10 "TOK" transcribed as printed (likely "TO K").
!
! EXTERNALS.  PNSLIN, PONOUT, PCW5, PD4 (landed p.293), GDELK, PDUMK,
! PHDK, PSTK, PSICK, PDKLS, PEBKS, PHOLDS, PINCS (landed p.292, copied
! in their defining SYN form), DMCP, DWS, DHOLD, DRET, PCDEF2, SICBU,
! SPRIMR, SPRIME (landed; forms as p.294 writes them), YMPBUF (p.319,
! form as p.320).  PH, PDKL, PSC, PDUM, PSTR, PEBK, PHOLDB: not landed;
! values from this page's binary (half word only; PHOLDB BIT-EXACT).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  VA000001 .. VA000051, one per line, none shared or
! skipped.

YMPBUF  SYN(BU), (8)234424.0         ! p.319 line 14 "YMPBUF DRZ(BU),1088" at 234424.00; SLC line 8 prints 234424.00
SICBU   SYN, (8)215361.0             ! landed (p.116 VF); LV line 9 215361.04
PD4     SYN, (8)232574.0             ! landed p.293 line 17 (!SYM 232574.00); B line 11 232574.10
PNSLIN  SYN(BU,64), (8)232613.0      ! landed p.293 line 41 DRZ(BU,64),(13) at 232613.00
PONOUT  SYN(BU,64), (8)232630.0      ! landed p.293 line 42 DRZ(BU,64),(13) at 232630.00
PCW5    SYN, (8)232650.0             ! landed p.293 line 48 CW at 232650.00; ,PCW5 line 42 232650.00
GDELK   SYN,0.44                     ! landed p.292 line 7, as defined there
PDUMK   SYN,0.46                     ! landed p.292 line 9
PHDK    SYN,0.47                     ! landed p.292 line 10
PSTK    SYN,0.48                     ! landed p.292 line 11
PSICK   SYN,0.16                     ! landed p.292 line 12
PDKLS   SYN,2.16                     ! landed p.292 line 13
PEBKS   SYN,2.17                     ! landed p.292 line 14
PHOLDS  SYN,2.16                     ! landed p.292 line 20
PINCS   SYN,2.17                     ! landed p.292 line 21
DMCP    SYN, 32.0                    ! landed p.108 "D MCP SYN,32.0"; lines 39, 47
DWS     SYN, 1.33                    ! landed p.104; ,DWS line 40 000001.41
PCDEF2  SYN, 10.0                    ! landed p.137; ,PCDEF2 line 41 000012.00
DHOLD   SYN, 65.32                   ! landed p.105 line 34; ,DHOLD line 46 000101.40
DRET    SYN, 33.0                    ! landed p.105; ,DRET line 48 000041.00
SPRIMR  SYN, (8)215571.0             ! landed p.118 line 49; SIC line 44 215571.00
SPRIME  SYN, (8)215570.0             ! landed p.118 line 48; BD line 45 215570.04
PSTR    SYN, (8)234656.40            ! not landed; BZB line 20 / BBZ line 32 234656.74, half word only
PEBK    SYN, (8)234535.40            ! not landed; BBZ line 22 234535.74, half word only
PH      SYN, (8)234502.0             ! not landed; BBZ line 24 234502.34, half word only
PDKL    SYN, (8)234507.0             ! not landed; BBZ line 26 234507.34, half word only
PSC     SYN, (8)234456.40            ! not landed (p.336's first word?); BBZ line 28 234456.74, half word only
PDUM    SYN, (8)234556.40            ! not landed; BBZ line 30 234556.74, half word only
PHOLDB  SYN, (8)234663.40            ! not landed; CM1111 line 43 234663.40, BIT-EXACT (as p.294)

! line  1  - ---------- DEBUGGER -------------------------------------------
        SLC, (8)236464.31            ! STAND-IN for the counter the page before leaves: this line's printed location -- see header
        PUNFUL                                               ! line  2
        (CC*)DD(BU,,12),B        HED, REP, 22$DUMP, LOAD,,           *   ! line  3
        (CC*)DD(BU,,12),                           22$DUMP*   ! line  4
        PUNORG                                               ! line  5
        PUNID,22$DUMP                                        ! line  6
        RESEQ                                                ! line  7
        SLC,YMPBUF                                           ! line  8
YDBBEG  LV,$2,SICBU                                          ! line  9
        LVI,$12,$+1.0                                        ! line 10  - TOK DISPLAY IC
        B,PD4                                                ! line 11
! line 12  -        -ANY DEBUGGING ACTIONS DEFINED
        CT0011(BU,5),PNSLIN+GDELK                            ! line 13  -IS ANY OF THE 5 KEYS ON
        BZRZ,PDB1                                            ! line 14
        BB,PNSLIN+PSICK,PDB1                                 ! line 15
        CT1100(BU,2),PNSLIN+PDKLS,0                          ! line 16  -ARE BOTH ENTER FROM BINARY
! line 17  -              - KEYS AND DISPLAY ON BINARY KEY LITES SET
        BRZ,PINC                                             ! line 18  -YES  TURN ON INCOMP COMBO LITE
        BB,PNSLIN+PDKLS,PDB1                                 ! line 19  -ANY OF SWITCHES ON
        BZB,PNSLIN+PEBKS,PSTR                                ! line 20  - NONE ON
PDB1    LVI,$14,$+.32                                        ! line 21
        BBZ,PNSLIN+PEBKS,PEBK                                ! line 22  -ENTER FROM BINARY KEYS
        LVI,$14,$+.32                                        ! line 23
        BBZ,PNSLIN+PHDK,PH                                   ! line 24  -HOLD KEY ON
        LVI,$14,$+.32                                        ! line 25
        BBZ,PNSLIN+PDKLS,PDKL                                ! line 26  -DISPLAY ON BINARY KEY LITES
        LVI,$14,$+.32                                        ! line 27
        BBZ,PNSLIN+PSICK,PSC                                 ! line 28  -SET IC
        LVI,$14,$+.32                                        ! line 29
        BBZ,PNSLIN+PDUMK,PDUM                                ! line 30  -DUMP
        LVI,$14,$+.32                                        ! line 31
        BBZ,PNSLIN+PSTK,PSTR                                 ! line 32  -START
! line 33  -
! line 34  -        -NO MORE CNSL REQUESTS AND START KEY NOT ON
PE1     Z,PONOUT+2.0                                         ! line 35
        CM1111(BU,1),PONOUT+PHOLDS                           ! line 36  -TURN ON HOLD LITE
PE4     LX,$2,PNSLIN                                         ! line 37  -KEY SETTINGS
        SX,$2,PONOUT                                         ! line 38  -LEAVE NUM DISPLAY ALONE
PE2     B,DMCP                                               ! line 39
        ,DWS                                                 ! line 40
        ,PCDEF2                                              ! line 41
        ,PCW5                                                ! line 42
PE3     CM1111(BU,1),PHOLDB                                  ! line 43  -HOLD BIT ON
        SIC,SPRIMR                                           ! line 44
        BD,SPRIME                                            ! line 45
        ,DHOLD                                               ! line 46
        BE,DMCP                                              ! line 47
        ,DRET                                                ! line 48
PINC    Z,PONOUT+2.0                                         ! line 49
        CM1111(BU,1),PONOUT+PINCS,0                          ! line 50
        B,PE4                                                ! line 51

!SYM YDBBEG 234424.00
!SYM PDB1   234433.40
!SYM PE1    234444.40
!SYM PE4    234446.00
!SYM PE2    234447.00
!SYM PE3    234451.00
!SYM PINC   234454.40
!CHECK 234424.00 | 215361.04 30 | line 9 YDBBEG LV,$2,SICBU
!CHECK 234424.40 | 234425.71 01 | line 10 LVI,$12,$+1.0
!CHECK 234425.00 | 232574.10 00 | line 11 B,PD4 (printed "PC4")
!CHECK 234425.40 | 232613.54 80 005000.07 70 | line 13 CT0011(BU,5),PNSLIN+GDELK (printed "P NSLIN+G DELK")
!CHECK 234426.40 | 234433.74 C0 | line 14 BZRZ,PDB1 (printed "PCB1")
!CHECK 234427.00 | 232613.20 80 234433.74 02 | line 15 BB,PNSLIN+PSICK,PDB1
!CHECK 234430.00 | 232615.20 80 002000.31 70 | line 16 CT1100(BU,2),PNSLIN+PDKLS,0
!CHECK 234431.00 | 234454.74 C2 | line 18 BRZ,PINC
!CHECK 234431.40 | 232615.20 80 234433.74 02 | line 19 BB,PNSLIN+PDKLS,PDB1 (printed "PCB1")
!CHECK 234432.40 | 232615.21 80 234656.74 00 | line 20 BZB,PNSLIN+PEBKS,PSTR (h2 byte prints "0C" = 00)
!CHECK 234433.40 | 234434.35 01 | line 21 PDB1 LVI,$14,$+.32 (label printed "PCB1")
!CHECK 234434.00 | 232615.21 80 234535.74 06 | line 22 BBZ,PNSLIN+PEBKS,PEBK
!CHECK 234435.00 | 234435.75 01 | line 23 LVI,$14,$+.32
!CHECK 234435.40 | 232613.57 80 234502.34 06 | line 24 BBZ,PNSLIN+PHDK,PH
!CHECK 234436.40 | 234437.35 01 | line 25 LVI,$14,$+.32
!CHECK 234437.00 | 232615.20 80 234507.34 06 | line 26 BBZ,PNSLIN+PDKLS,PDKL (a "*" prints after the location)
!CHECK 234440.00 | 234440.75 01 | line 27 LVI,$14,$+.32
!CHECK 234440.40 | 232613.20 80 234456.74 06 | line 28 BBZ,PNSLIN+PSICK,PSC
!CHECK 234441.40 | 234442.35 01 | line 29 LVI,$14,$+.32
!CHECK 234442.00 | 232613.56 80 234556.74 06 | line 30 BBZ,PNSLIN+PDUMK,PDUM
!CHECK 234443.00 | 234443.75 01 | line 31 LVI,$14,$+.32
!CHECK 234443.40 | 232613.60 80 234656.74 06 | line 32 BBZ,PNSLIN+PSTK,PSTR
!CHECK 234444.40 | 232632.22 00 | line 35 PE1 Z,PONOUT+2.0 (label printed "P E1", "PCNCUT"; byte prints "C0" = 00)
!CHECK 234445.00 | 232632.20 80 001000.36 F0 | line 36 CM1111(BU,1),PONOUT+PHOLDS
!CHECK 234446.00 | 232613.04 10 | line 37 PE4 LX,$2,PNSLIN
!CHECK 234446.40 | 232630.05 10 | line 38 SX,$2,PONOUT
!CHECK 234447.00 | 000040.10 00 | line 39 PE2 B,DMCP (printed "P E2", "B,D MCP"; byte prints "C0" = 00)
!CHECK 234447.40 | 000001.41 80 | line 40 ,DWS (printed ",D W S")
!CHECK 234450.00 | 000012.00 80 | line 41 ,PCDEF2 (printed ",P C DEF2")
!CHECK 234450.40 | 232650.00 80 | line 42 ,PCW5 (printed ",P CW5")
!CHECK 234451.00 | 234663.40 80 001000.36 F0 | line 43 PE3 CM1111(BU,1),PHOLDB (printed "PHOLCB")
!CHECK 234452.00 | 215571.00 80 | line 44 SIC,SPRIMR (printed "SIC, S PRIMR")
!CHECK 234452.40 | 215570.04 00 | line 45 BD,SPRIME (a "*" prints after the location)
!CHECK 234453.00 | 000101.40 80 | line 46 ,DHOLD (printed ",D HOLC")
!CHECK 234453.40 | 000040.00 00 | line 47 BE,DMCP (printed "BE,CMCP"; "C00040.CC 00" = 000040.00 00)
